# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: arsynth-shared.jks is a deliberately public, shared signing key so
# that every CI build has the SAME signature and app updates can install over
# each other. It is NOT a production key — never use it to publish to Play.
!app/arsynth-shared.jks
